msgid ""
"# Compatibility\n"
"\n"
"<!-- Generated by `vp run sync:compatibility`. Do not edit by hand; run the "
"writer and commit. -->\n"
"\n"
"This page records the Instructure UI sources this pantoken build resolves "
"from, and which consumers\n"
"use them. Target versions are separate: only verified releases are claimed, "
"and releases newer than\n"
"the last verified release need review. Regenerate it with `vp run "
"sync:compatibility`; the\n"
"`gate:compatibility` check fails if it drifts.\n"
"\n"
"## Upstream sources\n"
"\n"
"The design tokens, Instructure custom icons, and Lucide catalog feed the "
"resolved token IR that every\n"
"package consumes. The `@instructure/ui-*` React packages are used only by\n"
"`@pantoken/react-markdown`.\n"
"\n"
"| Package                                  | Feeds        | "
"Range                                                 | "
"Resolved              |\n"
"| ---------------------------------------- | ------------ | "
"----------------------------------------------------- | "
"--------------------- |\n"
"| `@instructure/instructure-design-tokens` | token-ir     | "
"`github:instructure/instructure-design-tokens#v2.1.0` | "
"`v2.1.0@c7f0deea242d` |\n"
"| `@instructure/ui-icons`                  | icons        | "
"`^11.7.8`                                             | "
"`11.7.8`              |\n"
"| `lucide`                                 | icons        | "
"`^1.52.0`                                             | "
"`1.52.0`              |\n"
"| `@instructure/ui-heading`                | instui-react | "
"`^11.7.8`                                             | "
"`11.7.8`              |\n"
"| `@instructure/ui-text`                   | instui-react | "
"`^11.7.8`                                             | "
"`11.7.8`              |\n"
"| `@instructure/ui-link`                   | instui-react | "
"`^11.7.8`                                             | "
"`11.7.8`              |\n"
"| `@instructure/ui-list`                   | instui-react | "
"`^11.7.8`                                             | "
"`11.7.8`              |\n"
"| `@instructure/ui-table`                  | instui-react | "
"`^11.7.8`                                             | "
"`11.7.8`              |\n"
"| `@instructure/ui-view`                   | instui-react | "
"`^11.7.8`                                             | "
"`11.7.8`              |\n"
"| `@instructure/ui-img`                    | instui-react | "
"`^11.7.8`                                             | "
"`11.7.8`              |\n"
"| `@instructure/ui-alerts`                 | instui-react | "
"`^11.7.8`                                             | "
"`11.7.8`              |\n"
"\n"
